OL,3,GNEWSATribute to farmer who 'saved rare
OL,4,Acattle breed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bench has been unveiled in memory of
OL,7,Fa farmer and conservationist said to be
OL,8,Finstrumental in saving a rare breed of
OL,9,FBritish cattle from extinction.
OL,11,FThe bench in Newent, Gloucestershire,
OL,12,Fcelebrates Eric Freeman, who promoted
OL,13,FGloucester cattle, Cotswold sheep and
OL,14,FGloucestershire Old Spot pigs on his
OL,15,Ffarm in Taynton, and is credited with
OL,16,Fhelping to revive wassailing in the
OL,17,Fcounty.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
