OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1795852563
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSATribute to farmer who 'saved rare
OL,4,Acattle breed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe died in 2023 aged 91, and his
OL,7,Ffriend, cheese maker Charles Martell,
OL,8,Fremembered: "It would take Eric two
OL,9,Fhours to get from the library to the
OL,10,Fpost office because he knew everybody
OL,11,Fand he didn't do short chats."
OL,13,FFreeman's granddaughter, Natasha James,
OL,14,Fsaid he would have been "thrilled" by
OL,15,Fthe honour.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
